  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 102.22 Best management practices for trail construction and maintenance (Trail BMPs)",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 102.22 “Best management practices for trail construction and maintenance (Trail BMPs)” means “New Hampshire Best Management Practices for Erosion Control During Trail Maintenance and Construction” dated 2017, published by NH DNCR, available as noted in Appendix B.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1, #2, #3, and #4 at Chapter heading for Env-Wt 100) #12801, eff 12-15-19; renumbered by #13945 (formerly Env-Wt 102.23)",
